Legitimate aim: The police claimed the demonstration lacked notice and could cause public-order problems. The legitimate aims under Art 11(2) include public safety, prevention of disorder, protection of rights of others. So the aim is preventing disorder/public safety. So yes, legitimate aim. Facts: F013 (lack of notice), F014 (public-order problems), plus the law's purpose. So conclusion yes.

